      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To initiate the computer repair process, begin by examining the hardware."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause implicitly defines the process start and explicitly describes the initial hardware examination action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "label:n2->n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the hardware has been checked, proceed with repairing any issues that were identified."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly corresponds to the repair step triggered by identified issues. The label accurately summarizes the transition condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4",
        "label:n3->n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the necessary repairs have been made, conclude the hardware inspection."
      ],
      "justification": "Faithfully captures the conclusion action following repairs. The label reflects the stated completion condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Following the completion of the repair process, it is important to test the functionality of the system."
